  <div class="ts-insight-text">
    <em>It is forbidden to be old.</em><br>
    The essential life = beginning anew each time, as if you have never begun at all.<br>
    This is the secret of Tefillin — drawn from the holy elder<br>
    who was exceedingly old yet exceedingly young.
